<title>SOUTH KOREA: Miwon Petrochem limit-up on stake sales.</title>
<headline>Miwon Petrochem limit-up on stake sales.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of South Korea's Miwon Petrochemical Co rose their daily limit in Monday afternoon trading after Korea Kumho Petrochemical Co agreed to buy a controlling stake in Miwon, brokers said.</p>
<p>Miwon Petrochemial gained 640 won to 8,640.  </p>
<p>Korea Kumho shares rose 100 won to 6,450.</p>
<p>&quot;Investors appear to believe the company's earnings will improve for the long term under the new ownership,&quot; said a Hyundai Securities broker.</p>
<p>Korea Kumho said it had agreed to buy over the counter a 25.1 percent stake in Miwon Petrochemical at 25,880 won per share.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5646</p>
</text>
